# FIN-010: Q1 2023 Quarterly Report

**MedSync Health**
**Reporting Period:** January 1, 2023 – March 31, 2023
**Date of Issue:** April 25, 2023
**Currency:** United Arab Emirates Dirham (AED)

---

## 1. Executive Summary

MedSync Health delivered a strong performance in the first quarter of 2023, driven by continued adoption of our core platform, MedSync Connect, and the successful integration of new enterprise clients. Total revenue for Q1 2023 reached **AED 80,850,000**, representing a significant year-over-year (YoY) growth of **57.15%** compared to Q1 2022 (AED 51,450,000). This growth trajectory is a testament to the strategic investments made in our product and sales teams in the latter half of 2022.

Key operational milestones included the successful completion of the **Epic Systems Integration** in January 2023, a major partnership that unlocks access to a substantial new segment of the hospital market. Our focus remains on expanding our market share in North America and EMEA while maintaining high standards of data security and compliance (See **SEC-001** for compliance details).

