### 3.2. Key Milestones

The Q1 2023 period was marked by significant strategic progress:

*   **Product Integration:** Successful launch of the Epic Systems Integration in January 2023, significantly enhancing the value proposition of **MedSync Connect**. Further details on product development can be found in **PROD-001**.
*   **Compliance:** Maintained all certifications, including ISO 27001 (certified November 2022) and HIPAA Compliance. The company is preparing for its next SOC 2 Type II renewal in August 2024.

## 4. Forward-Looking Statement

The company is well-positioned to achieve its full-year revenue target of **AED 367,500,000** for FY 2023. The successful Q1 performance provides a strong foundation for the remainder of the year, with Q2 2023 revenue projected to be **AED 88,200,000**. We continue to focus on expanding our customer base, driving Net Revenue Retention (NRR), and preparing for the upcoming Series D funding round planned for June 2024.

